        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Your <em>sectioned</em> weapon separates into linked segments joined by fine chain, or draws back together into a single solid weapon.</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Toggle the <em>Effect: Sectioned (Unfolded)</em> effect on yourself. While unfolded, the weapon gains the reach trait, you take a &minus;2 circumstance penalty to Strikes against adjacent creatures, and critical hits deal 1d4 persistent bleed damage.</p>"
